= LPS Weighing Library Software History (0.3.0)

.Release Information
[width="30%"]
|====================================
| Date              | 2017-02-16
| Release Label/Tag | 0.3.0
| Released By       | Subba Gundala
|====================================

== Release Summary Information

=== Overload Warnings added to Best Bucket Weight (gundas1)

Overload Warnings added to Best Bucket Weight.

=== Unused LpsDumpDetect and ZeroWeight variables removed (gundas1)

Unused LpsDumpDetect and ZeroWeight variables removed.

=== Zero Adjust moved from Live Weight to LLW and changed the order of Update (gundas1)

Zero Adjust moved from Live Weight to LLW and changed the order of Update

=== Changed the threshold of velocities (gundas1)

Changed the threshold of velocities in LpsProcess.c from 0 to +/- 1 for linkage raise and lower respectively owing to filter abnormalities

=== Fixed all GTest scripts with the changes made to the library (gundas1)

Fixed all GTest scripts with the changes made to the library

=== Replaced Cmd Per with  TiltCylVel (gundas1)

Replaced Cmd Per with  TiltCylVel

=== Implemented PIDs D10933 and D10822 (gundas1)

Implemented PIDs D10933 and D10822

=== Moved prototypes of files needed for Wrapper (gundas1)

Moved prototypes of files needed for Wrapper to use from LpsPrivate.h to LpsPublic.h

=== Reset too heavy to zero in best bucket weight reset (gundas1)

Reset too heavy to zero in best bucket weight reset.

=== Reset zero accepted status when LLW latched (gundas1)

Reset zero accepted status when LLW latched.

=== Replaced function LpsWeighSetZeroNeededStatus  (gundas1)

Replaced function LpsWeighSetZeroNeededStatus with LpsWeighSetAutoZeroUpdateStatus since its renamed.

=== Initialize zero temp default value in init function  (gundas1)

Initialize zero temp default value in init function.

=== Assigned best bucket weight to zero weight instead of WRW WtAvg  (gundas1)

Assigned best bucket weight to zero weight instead of WRW WtAvg.

=== Modified weighing library make file to pickup filter library from new location (gundas1)

Modified weighing library make file to pickup filter library from new location, cpm_filters target repo.

=== Changed SnoozedStatus data type (gundas1)

Changed SnoozedStatus data type from unsigned_8 to LpsZeroNeededStatus_t.

